        "TileImage": "$($repository 9b0d0651-4f81-40e5-bf2a-5aec6fd763a5).Image",
        "Description": "A contract has been issued\r\rWe have intel that the Anti-Furry Community had made a deal and offer to the Kronstadt Industries to build an army of robots and drones for war. While engineers and researchers question the ongoing declaration war over the Furry Community, one of the Anti-Furry community sent a US Military Consultant is here to purchase the latest robots. Stop the Knoxes, as well as other figures who can hold the power of the industries. Prevent the War.\r\rI shall leave you to prepare.",
